{"4575080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lost Exit", "steam_appid": 4575080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4830140], "detailed_description": "<h1>Join the Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575080/extras/e6f8a40e88cad52e324cb72f3e61ba4c.avif?t=1782098606\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575080/extras_big/e6f8a40e88cad52e324cb72f3e61ba4c.webp?t=1782098606 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Community</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to stay updated on development, share feedback, or connect with other players, you can join the official Discord server.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s the best place to follow progress between updates and be part of ongoing discussions around the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👉 </p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the quiet decay of Crestwood Mall… where something isn’t quite right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lost Exit</i> is a first-person psychological horror experience set in a sprawling, infamous shopping mall frozen in time. What begins as a routine night shift quickly unravels into something far more disturbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lights flicker. The halls stretch longer than they should. And the deeper you go, the more the mall begins to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are alone… or at least, you think you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a haunting environment inspired by American shopping malls from the 90s, and liminal spaces. Navigate through maintenance corridors, shuttered storefronts, and forgotten attractions as you uncover fragments of a story buried beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the mystery of Crestwood and survive the descent into madness, as the mall tests your awareness, psyche, and nerve. Every decision matters, and not every path leads out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mall is watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it doesn’t want you to leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Psychological Horror</strong><br>Experience a slow-burning descent into dread with cinematic visuals and atmospheric sound design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575080/extras/8376dd3e636f44aced17035e7a8fbea7.poster.avif?t=1782098606\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575080/extras/8376dd3e636f44aced17035e7a8fbea7.webm?t=1782098606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575080/extras/8376dd3e636f44aced17035e7a8fbea7.mp4?t=1782098606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Exploration</strong><br>Traverse a massive interconnected mall filled with secrets, hidden paths, and shifting environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575080/extras/7c12151bbf4eeb7a51d9da35e331963d.poster.avif?t=1782098606\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575080/extras/7c12151bbf4eeb7a51d9da35e331963d.webm?t=1782098606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575080/extras/7c12151bbf4eeb7a51d9da35e331963d.mp4?t=1782098606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven Gameplay</strong> <br>In <i>Lost Exit, </i>the story is told through shifting environments, psychological tension, and eerie silence. What starts as a routine assignment slowly unravels into something far more disturbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575080/extras/db2be2df2d3d526a16a10059a3b131a1.poster.avif?t=1782098606\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575080/extras/db2be2df2d3d526a16a10059a3b131a1.webm?t=1782098606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575080/extras/db2be2df2d3d526a16a10059a3b131a1.mp4?t=1782098606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Aesthetic</strong> <br>A gritty 35mm-inspired visual style that blends realism with analog horror, inspired by American malls in the 90s</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575080/extras/22b69c89b250c171f9999e4f368139ec.poster.avif?t=1782098606\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575080/extras/22b69c89b250c171f9999e4f368139ec.webm?t=1782098606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575080/extras/22b69c89b250c171f9999e4f368139ec.mp4?t=1782098606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Truth</strong><br>Piece together the mystery of Crestwood Mall… if your sanity can survive long enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=